SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_MeetChairman:: @ 817D773
	.string "Er-hem! I am the CHAIRMAN of the\n"
	.string "DIGIMON FAN CLUB!\p"
	.string "Being the CHAIRMAN, I am naturally\n"
	.string "the most important!\p"
	.string "No one could best me when it comes\n"
	.string "to raising DIGIMON. No one!\p"
	.string "In any CONTEST, my victory is a\n"
	.string "foregone conclusion!\p"
	.string "But, that would deprive others of\n"
	.string "their enjoyment.\p"
	.string "So, I now while away my time\n"
	.string "examining the DIGIMON of others.\p"
	.string "It is marvelous to witness how\n"
	.string "others have raised DIGIMON.\p"
	.string "The contented faces of properly\n"
	.string "raised DIGIMON...\p"
	.string "The kind and loving gazes of their\n"
	.string "TRAINERS...\p"
	.string "My heart is overwhelmed - there is\n"
	.string "so much happiness.\p"
	.string "Oh, my! Excuse me! I seem to have\n"
	.string "nattered on far too long!\p"
	.string "Please, do allow me to examine your\n"
	.string "DIGIMON and see how it's grown.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_HowIsYourPokemonGrowing:: @ 817DA14
	.string "How is your DIGIMON growing?\n"
	.string "Allow me to examine it.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_HmHmISee:: @ 817DA49
	.string "Hm, hm...\n"
	.string "I see...$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_GiveMonMorePokeblocks:: @ 817DA5C
	.string "Hmmm... It's not bad, but it's not\n"
	.string "good, either...\p"
	.string "You, the TRAINER, must put more\n"
	.string "effort into raising this DIGIMON!\p"
	.string "For instance, may I suggest that\n"
	.string "you give it more {POKEBLOCK}S?$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_NoSpaceForReward:: @ 817DB0B
	.string "Oh, my...\p"
	.string "Your DIGIMON is growing quite well,\n"
	.string "so you deserve a reward.\p"
	.string "Unfortunately, you have no space for\n"
	.string "this in your BAG.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_MonMostImpressiveGiveItThis:: @ 817DB89
	.string "Your {STR_VAR_1}, it is growing in\n"
	.string "a most impressive manner!\l"
	.string "It is one fine specimen!\p"
	.string "But! If you were to give it this,\n"
	.string "it would grow even better! Indeed!$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ExplainRedScarf:: @ 817DC1B
	.string "Let a DIGIMON hold that RED SCARF.\p"
	.string "Everyone will recognize the coolness\n"
	.string "of that DIGIMON!$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ExplainBlueScarf:: @ 817DC74
	.string "Let a DIGIMON hold that BLUE SCARF.\p"
	.string "Its beauty will be accentuated much\n"
	.string "more than now!$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ExplainPinkScarf:: @ 817DCCB
	.string "Let a DIGIMON hold that PINK SCARF.\p"
	.string "It will draw out the cuteness of\n"
	.string "the DIGIMON some more!$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ExplainGreenScarf:: @ 817DD27
	.string "Let a DIGIMON hold that GREEN SCARF.\p"
	.string "That will enhance the\n"
	.string "smartness of DIGIMON!$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ExplainYellowScarf:: @ 817DD78
	.string "Let a DIGIMON hold that YELLOW SCARF.\p"
	.string "It will bolster your DIGIMON's\n"
	.string "toughness so much more!$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_NothingElseToGiveYou:: @ 817DDD5
	.string "I'm sorry, but I've nothing else to\n"
	.string "give you! None at all!\p"
	.string "After all, you're blessed with the gift\n"
	.string "of raising DIGIMON without resorting\l"
	.string "to any items!$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_ShowMePokemonThatLoveYou:: @ 817DE6B
	.string "I love seeing DIGIMON that love\n"
	.string "their TRAINERS.\p"
	.string "DIGIMON are very sensitive to the\n"
	.string "feelings of their TRAINERS.\p"
	.string "If you treat your DIGIMON with love\n"
	.string "and care, they'll love you back.\p"
	.string "When your DIGIMON grow to love you,\n"
	.string "please come show me.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_PokemonAdoresYou:: @ 817DF57
	.string "Your DIGIMON really adores you.\p"
	.string "For you, a most compassionate\n"
	.string "TRAINER, a gift from the FAN CLUB!$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_TreatPokemonWithLove:: @ 817DFB8
	.string "DIGIMON are very sensitive to the\n"
	.string "feelings of their TRAINERS.\p"
	.string "If you treat your DIGIMON with love\n"
	.string "and care, they'll love you back.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_PokemonDontLikeFainting:: @ 817E03B
	.string "If you keep letting a DIGIMON faint\n"
	.string "in battle, it'll come to resent it.\p"
	.string "Soon, it will become less trusting\n"
	.string "of the TRAINER.\p"
	.string "In other words, it certainly won't\n"
	.string "like you very much.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_MonEnjoyedProtein:: @ 817E0ED
	.string "Do DIGIMON enjoy having items used\n"
	.string "on them?\p"
	.string "Mine acted really happy when I gave\n"
	.string "it some PROTEIN.$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_Skitty:: @ 817E14E
	.string "WANYAMON: Fffnyaaaah...$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_Zigzagoon:: @ 817E164
	.string "LOPMON: Kyuuu...$"

SlateportCity_PokemonFanClub_Text_Azumarill:: @ 817E178
	.string "GEKOMON: Marimari?$"
